      "Use a regulated, current-limited 5 V source at J1. Observe pin 1 on U1 and the polarity of C1 and D1.",
      "SW1 pulls TRIGGER low. For the one-shot demonstration release the button before the nominal 1.1 s pulse ends. Contact bounce and long or repeated presses are outside the modeled trigger event.",
      "CBYP is the 100 nF supply capacitor. The model omits timer tolerances, saturation, startup and retriggering."
    ]
